    "body": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://innioasis.app/guide.html?repo=ryan-specter%2Fkoensayr-auto&amp;tag=2.4.0-koensayr-3.0.7#download-updater\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/koensayr-auto-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-updater.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Get it on Updater CE - with guided install\"></a>\n</p>\n\n### Downloads\n\n**Y1 \u00b7 Type A**\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/y1-community/koensayr-auto-mirror/releases/download/2.4.0-koensayr-3.0.7/rom-windows.zip\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/koensayr-auto-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-windows.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for Windows for Y1 \u00b7 Type A - x86-64 \u00b7 portable package\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/y1-community/koensayr-auto-mirror/releases/download/2.4.0-koensayr-3.0.7/rom-linux.zip\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/koensayr-auto-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-linux.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for Linux for Y1 \u00b7 Type A - x86-64 \u00b7 portable package\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/y1-community/koensayr-auto-mirror/releases/download/2.4.0-koensayr-3.0.7/rom-linux-arm64.zip\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/koensayr-auto-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-linux-arm64.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for Linux arm64 for Y1 \u00b7 Type A - portable package\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/y1-community/koensayr-auto-mirror/releases/download/2.4.0-koensayr-3.0.7/rom-macos.zip\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/koensayr-auto-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-macos.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for macOS 12+ for Y1 \u00b7 Type A - Intel + Apple silicon\"></a>\n</p>\n\n---\n\n# 2.4.0-koensayr-3.0.7\n\nKoensayr is a mod for the Y1's OS that makes the following improvements to the original OS:\n\nBrowsing the albums of an artist from Main Menu > Artists > Albums\n\nAdds Bluetooth remote control support and track info displayed on your bluetooth receiver, perfect for using your Y1 in a car with the infotainment system.\n\n\n---\n\n## Build metadata\n\nPatched **rom.zip** built from stock **3.0.7** by [koensayr-auto](https://github.com/ryan-specter/koensayr-auto) v2.4.0.\n\n## Upstream\n\n- Repository: [`y1-community/y1-stock-rom`](https://github.com/y1-community/y1-stock-rom)\n- Release tag: `Latest-3.0.7`\n- Asset: `rom.zip`\n- Upstream SHA256: `7cbffcbe7dc1beb823e9ab8d37cea6120d16856bba49e02ed2d6e1548832e695`\n\n## Koensayr build\n\n- Version: `2.4.0`\n- Git revision: `16f65333696597b084d34931d4c94f7c5352e9e5` (includes `com.innioasis.y1` APK patches under `src/patches/`)\n\n## Build output\n\n- Patched `rom.zip` SHA256: `b5b8cfbb651460e989a2cfb93a4f9b5e610a76015103e69bac382ba65f9bf97a` (see `build-manifest.json` on this release)\n- Upstream `rom.zip` was re-hashed at build time; output must differ (CI enforces this).\n\n## Patches (`--all`)\n\n- Music-player UX (Artist\u2192Album navigation)\n- Bluetooth pairing (`audio.conf` / `auto_pairing.conf` / `blacklist.conf` / `build.prop`)\n- System config (ADB debugging, bloatware removal)\n- Root (`/system/xbin/su`, mode 06755)\n- AVRCP 1.3 metadata + control + Y1Bridge\n\nDiagnostic scripts (`tools/dual-capture.sh`, gdb attach, `btlog-dump`) are **not** included in the ROM \u2014 see the repo [Diagnostics](https://github.com/ryan-specter/koensayr-auto#diagnostics).\n\n## After flash\n\nIf AVRCP / MultiDex classes fail to load after upgrading from a prior koensayr build:\n\n```bash\nadb shell rm -rf /data/data/com.innioasis.y1/code_cache/secondary-dexes/\n```\n\n<!-- portable-mirror:{\"assets\":[{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-linux.zip\",\"platform\":\"linux\",\"sha256\":\"7a4c9c3475aab75b55c89182e5219a6c1dc61328d9c4132ab3a0ddb7b251a86f\",\"size\":607146160,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\",\"type\":\"Type A\"},{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-linux-arm64.zip\",\"platform\":\"linux-arm64\",\"sha256\":\"24a3757dba9e1ce6b72f1bb67ee80ad38106a07c8e1f434934a3522d21a8a3a4\",\"size\":432051102,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\",\"type\":\"Type A\"},{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-macos.zip\",\"platform\":\"macos\",\"sha256\":\"0120dd7fb84a298e496fb7fcd18c7df8c201e03703cad01319420c33517debb9\",\"size\":359292333,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\",\"type\":\"Type A\"},{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-windows.zip\",\"platform\":\"windows\",\"sha256\":\"9159089705883be6602b364d07c128dc36c4263ee9480cf0b59c86db72a4a268\",\"size\":443517526,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\",\"type\":\"Type A\"}],\"built_at\":\"2026-11-11T00:36:41Z\",\"button_assets\":[{\"name\":\"release-button-updater.svg\",\"size\":1540},{\"name\":\"release-button-windows.svg\",\"size\":1522},{\"name\":\"release-button-linux.svg\",\"size\":1518},{\"name\":\"release-button-linux-arm64.svg\",\"size\":1510},{\"name\":\"release-button-macos.svg\",\"size\":1516}],\"failures\":[],\"fingerprint\":\"c4d9773b7b983cd44a97bfb64511bef48b38a367eaa861a825c3aad298858014\",\"original_asset_sizes\":{\"build-manifest.json\":545,\"rom.zip\":308982866},\"original_assets\":[\"build-manifest.json\",\"rom.zip\"],\"skipped\":[],\"stats\":{\"baseline\":{\"build-manifest.json\":11,\"rom-linux-arm64.zip\":0,\"rom-linux.zip\":1,\"rom-macos.zip\":3,\"rom-windows.zip\":1,\"rom.zip\":10},\"generated_at\":\"2026-11-11T00:36:41Z\",\"retired\":{}},\"updater\":{\"linux\":{\"name\":\"UpdaterCE-Linux-Portable.zip\",\"size\":363859936,\"tag\":\"2.5.3\"},\"linux-arm64\":{\"name\":\"UpdaterCE-Linux-Portable-arm64.zip\",\"size\":187878034,\"tag\":\"2.5.3\"},\"macos\":{\"name\":\"Innioasis.Updater.for.Mac.dmg\",\"size\":119710372,\"tag\":\"2.5.3\"},\"windows\":{\"name\":\"UpdaterCE-Windows-Portable.zip\",\"size\":205854850,\"tag\":\"2.5.3\"}},\"v\":13} -->\n",
